  "notes": "Battery only, on RFCOMM channel 1 (16 refused). The earbuds send an empty 01 06 when the channel opens, announce the battery on their own (01 27) and answer the query (01 08) with the same tags. A bud in the case reads 0 and is left out. Tag 3 stayed 00 00 00 with a bud charging in the case, so charging is not reported. No noise control on this model: the line lists no modes. Frames from session 2 of the capture.",
